            "paragraph": "During the winter 1988-89, input meteorological data necessary to allow the model to run were measured hourly: air temperature and humidity, wind velocity, incoming short-wave and long-wave radiation, liquid and solid precipitation. Precipitation was measured using three rain gauges, one heated, one using dissolution in alcohol and the last one unheated.",
